  "description": "<p><b>Product information:</b><br/>Crafted from full-grain cowhide, this women's crossbody bag features a simple and leisurely European and American style. The design includes double compartments and multiple internal pockets, such as a zippered change purse and mobile phone pocket, catering to diverse storage needs for daily use.<br/><br/>With medium-to-soft hardness and a single shoulder strap, it offers comfortable carrying. This large-capacity handbag is a versatile choice for everyday outfits, commuting, or casual outings.<br/><br/>Material: Top-grain cowhide <br/>Leather features: Top-grain<br/>cowhide Bag size: Medium Lining <br/>material: Polyester cotton Trend<br/>elements: Solid colour, stitching, litchi texture, simple casual, messenger, leather texture, <br/>minimalist Hardness: Medium soft<br/>Colours: Black, elephant grey, ebony, yellow, ocean blue, wool <br/>white Style: European and American Bag shape: Horizontal <br/>square Opening: Zipper Internal <br/>structure: Zipper pocket, mobile pocket, middle zipper pocket<br/>External pocket type: Internal <br/>patch pocket With compartments: <br/>No Dimensions: Base length 24cm, base width 13cm, height 15cm Strap: Single strap</p> \n<br/> \n<b>Packing list: </b> \n<br/>1 x Women's Crossbody Bag \n<br/> \n \n<b>Product Image:</b> \n<br/> \n<img src=\"https://oss-cf.cjdropshipping.com/product/2026/10/25/02/d2be29bb-d468-4ca9-914a-01296299323c_trans.jpeg\"/> \n<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/quick/product/49f69127-fff1-441c-9e47-2bc84751f12a.jpg\"/> \n<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/quick/product/a4142d99-9765-4a28-914b-e8b26e797dd5.jpg\"/> \n<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/quick/product/d35364fc-b766-4bdf-bf77-1fac137496ad.jpg\"/> \n<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/quick/product/43adf1dd-79fc-4a13-8b79-d0ec6013bf25.jpg\"/> \n<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/quick/product/4e214c6f-cd98-4a73-aecf-c289b318dd33.jpg\"/> \n<img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshi